  "Codex has no individual built-in tools: instead of the selected ones ({}) you have its shell (exec_command, write_stdin), apply_patch, view_image, list_mcp_resources, list_mcp_resource_templates and read_mcp_resource, without asking — {}. The shell reads every file your process may read, not only the project, and view_image shows you any such image file; list_mcp_resources, list_mcp_resource_templates and read_mcp_resource only read what the MCP servers of this run offer as resources.": "Codex kennt keine einzelnen eingebauten Werkzeuge: statt der gewählten ({0}) hast du seine Shell (exec_command, write_stdin), apply_patch, view_image, list_mcp_resources, list_mcp_resource_templates und read_mcp_resource, ohne Nachfrage — {1}. Die Shell liest jede Datei, die dein Prozess lesen darf, nicht nur das Projekt, und view_image zeigt dir jede solche Bilddatei; list_mcp_resources, list_mcp_resource_templates und read_mcp_resource lesen nur, was die MCP-Server dieses Laufs als Ressource anbieten.",
